'90s early '00s teen drama genre - Dawson's Creek, The O.C., Sweet Valley High, etc. with new Archetypes including the Lovesick and the Wunderkind, and Cinematics designed for playing Coldplay at appropriate moments!</li> </ol><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/they-came-from-the-rpg-anthology-tabletop-roleplaying-game/posts/3820571\u200b\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...sts/3820571\u200b</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-01T12:56:57-07:00","id":1513561,"title":"","content":"For those interested - We analyze <b>Storypath Ultra</b> general mechanics changes unveiled in Kickstarter in this forum topic.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/storypath-system/1512822-storypath-ultra-basics\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/storypath-system/1512822-storypath-ultra-basics\"> Storypath Ultra Basics - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/storypath-system/1512822-storypath-ultra-basics\"> https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/storypath-system/1512822-storypath-ultra-basics </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Preparing topic for May 30th premiere of new rules on They Came From the RPG Anthology (https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/they-came-from-the-rpg-anthology-tabletop-roleplaying-game) Kickstarter. I plan to look over major changes between original Storypath ( SP 1.0 from now on ) and SP Ultra rules. :cool: </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-01-2023, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T01:26:52-07:00","id":1514556,"title":"","content":"They Came From RPG Anthology is funded! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> We are 11 days to end, we will see if we get new Stretch Goals then. <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/they-came-from-the-rpg-anthology-tabletop-roleplaying-game/posts/3831222\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/3831222</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T06:35:41-07:00","id":1514691,"title":"","content":"I wonder if there will be room for Wuxia or Street Fighter style shennanigans?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T07:50:53-07:00","id":1514698,"title":"","content":"New Monday, new They Came From poll! This week we choose between Heist movies, Pirate movies and Samurai movies. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> They all go head to head in polls! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><ul><li><b>They Came from the Meticulously Planned Bank Job!</b> (Heist and Gangster Media - Ocean's Eleven, Reservoir Dogs, Goodfellas, etc. with new rules for planning your caper and building your reputation in the criminal underworld, including Archetypes such as the Mafioso, the Professional, and the Hitman.)</li> <li><b>They Came from Avast Behind! </b>(Adventure Movies and TV, especially focusing on pirates - Treasure Island, Our Flag Means Death, Three Musketeers, Mutiny on the Bounty, etc., with a flurry of exciting new Archetypes and Quips based on an adventurous life, including the Captain, the Swashbuckler, and the Scurvy Dog.)</li> <li><b>They Came from the Code of Bushido! </b>(Samurai Movie Genre - everything Kurosawa, 13 Assassins, Zatoichi, etc. with a system for duels, mass battles and declarative Quips, including Archetypes such as the Sword Master, the Old Hand, the Divine Avenger, and the Stoic Monk.)</li> </ul><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/they-came-from-the-rpg-anthology-tabletop-roleplaying-game/posts/3833048\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/3833048</a><br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-15T15:53:18-07:00","id":1515186,"title":"","content":"Polls have closed and like any good gangster movie <b>They Came from the Meticulously Planned Bank Job!</b>\u200b pulls it out at the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}